// The libraries vnvideo.c compiles into itself: pl_mpeg, whose functions get a vnvideo_ prefix so an engine that
// compiles its own copy, as NScripter does, links beside vnvideo without duplicate symbols. libogg, libtheora and
// libopus are compiled as their own files. The pragma keeps warnings about unmodified upstream code out of builds
// that turn warnings into errors.
